#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:56
#: a0a4ca2d4c7743df93e8d3852a854eb2
msgid "How to configure a MULTIPLEX receiver for SRXL signal output"
msgstr "如何为 MULTIPLEX 接收机配置 SRXL 信号输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:57
#: def10760ba98492ebdaae34dc02b697e
msgid ""
"To configure the receiver to send out SRXL signal you need a USB to UART "
"Adapter."
msgstr "要配置接收机输出 SRXL 信号，您需要 USB 转 UART 适配器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:62
#: fa012af9edf94f09919ad77c9a1e6c73
msgid ""
"For this purpose MULTIPLEX offers the plug-and-play `PC-cable # 85149 "
"<https://www.multiplex-rc.de/produkte/85149-usb-pc-kabel-rx-s-telemetrie-"
"uni>`__ which contains a SILABS CP2102 Single-chip USB to UART Bridge."
msgstr ""
"为此，MULTIPLEX 提供即插即用的 `PC 数据线 # 85149 <https://www.multiplex-"
"rc.de/produkte/85149-usb-pc-kabel-rx-s-telemetrie-uni>`__，内含 SILABS CP2102 "
"单芯片 USB 转 UART 桥接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:64
#: 4051a2e11505455786cdf85c3c879c47
msgid "To do the configuration follow the following steps:"
msgstr "请按以下步骤进行配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:66
#: c0c43aea145043b5ad1dc5c56d477da9
msgid ""
"Download and install `MULTIPLEX Launcher "
"<http://www.wingstabi.de/download/mpx_launcher.exe>`__ Software"
msgstr ""
"下载并安装 `MULTIPLEX Launcher "
"<http://www.wingstabi.de/download/mpx_launcher.exe>`__ 软件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:67
#: ee8c1d723cd64d69a2340555fee1ebaf
msgid ""
"With Transmitter switched off, connect PC-cable # 85149 to a B/D port of the"
" receiver and connect a sufficient power supply to any of the servo sockets."
msgstr "关闭发射机，将 PC 数据线 # 85149 连接到接收机的 B/D 端口，并向任一舵机插槽连接充足电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:68
#: f785f326d03641dda2d68fa33b60f2d0
msgid ""
"Start the MULTIPLEX Launcher Software and connect PC-cable # 85149 to the "
"PC."
msgstr "启动 MULTIPLEX Launcher 软件，并将 PC 数据线 # 85149 连接到电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:69
#: 29fad95713724396b95664a061b476e6
msgid ""
"MULTIPLEX Launcher will detect the connected device automatically and will "
"open the “RX/RF DataManager”-Window."
msgstr "MULTIPLEX Launcher 将自动检测已连接的设备，并打开 「RX/RF DataManager」 窗口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:74
#: 6fb5c7f803b24fbcb2f7815150f88123
msgid ""
"In the “RX/RF DataManager”-Window click “Options” and the “RX "
"Options”-Window will be opened."
msgstr "在 「RX/RF DataManager」 窗口中点击 「Options」，将打开 「RX Options」 窗口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:79
#: 1e744fa4a9d14b08917b9ea37eb61641
msgid ""
"In the “RX-Options” Window scroll down to “More Settings”. In the “More "
"Settings” section double-click “* Options…” to open the “More "
"setting”-Window and select “Serial servodata SRXL” as data output at B/D "
"port. Close the “More setting”-Windows by clicking “Accept”."
msgstr ""
"在 「RX-Options」 窗口中向下滚动至 「More Settings」。在 「More Settings」 部分双击 「* Options…」 "
"打开 「More setting」 窗口，并将 B/D 端口的数据输出选择为 「Serial servodata SRXL」。点击 「Accept」 "
"关闭 「More setting」 窗口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:84
#: 57e64e50bcbc4ba8a3d77c67e86712ec
msgid ""
"Upload data to the receiver by clicking “Send data” in the “RX "
"Options”-Window."
msgstr "在 「RX Options」 窗口中点击 「Send data」 将数据上传到接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:87
#: 5bd3aebbc1424c39bba7becdd7b832cc
msgid ""
"There will be no active feedback of the receiver to show you that data are "
"stored successfully. But no worries – they will be stored reliably."
msgstr "接收机不会有主动反馈来显示数据已成功存储，但无需担心——数据会被可靠保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:89
#: 3d2904e39c004fcfbe769daeee6c7910
msgid ""
"To complete the SRXL activation on B/D port click “Close” in the “RX "
"Options”-Window and “Close” in the “RX/RF DataManager”-Window."
msgstr ""
"要完成 B/D 端口上 SRXL 的激活，在 「RX Options」 窗口中点击 「Close」，再在 「RX/RF DataManager」 "
"窗口中点击 「Close」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:90
#: fb5f1b8de93f4f55bf00d6c90d665833
msgid ""
"To reboot the receiver, disconnect PC-cable and power supply from the "
"receiver."
msgstr "断开接收机的 PC 数据线和电源以重启接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:91
#: 391d04ef598a401a8063f321142275e3
msgid "Receiver is now configured for SRXL output."
msgstr "接收机现已配置为 SRXL 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-srxl-receivers.rst:92
#: 90b5503d57d3430ab50efc78da14f06c
msgid ""
"Connect receivers to the autopilot as described :ref:`here <common-rc-"
"systems>`."
msgstr "按 :ref:`此处 <common-rc-systems>` 所述将接收机连接到飞控。"

