msgid ""
"Test and adjust servo channel assignments in Mission planner if required. "
"MULTIPLEX radios without free servo assignment (e.g. Cockpit SX) have the "
"following standard servo assignment:"
msgstr ""
"如有需要，在 Mission Planner 中测试并调整舵机通道分配。没有自由舵机分配功能的 MULTIPLEX 遥控器（如 Cockpit "
"SX）具有以下标准舵机分配："
